# Normalize line endings so the built grid.cjs is byte-stable across machines
# (the build step writes LF; without this, Windows checkouts churn LF<->CRLF on every rebuild
# and would also flip the startup content-hash build id).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
